  "changelog": "universal-file-ops 1.3.0 introduces a hook-based phased workflow, structured reporting, and stricter file I/O discipline.\n\n- Added a process \"hook runner\" system enforcing three-phase execution (environment, file ops, script pipeline).\n- Introduced modular scripts for workflow automation: fix_and_test, hook_runner, run_all_tests, update_version.\n- Enforced atomic file writes and prohibited direct open()/write() calls outside approved wrappers.\n- Added structured report templates (A/B/C) and detailed changelog, error codes, and permissions documentation.\n- Improved split of documentation into progressive, on-demand reference files.\n- Removed legacy test and utility scripts, consolidating test/process commands under new management scripts.",
